.agentlogs/

# Review scratch (PLAN §11 — reviewer logs are intentionally local)
docs/reviews/.*.log
docs/reviews/.*.err
docs/reviews/.*.tmp
# Compiled binaries (never commit — a 23MB exe was tracked once already)
/kanban
/kanban.exe
*.exe
